    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "algorithm",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "<div class=\"mineru-algorithm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-family:monospace;\">\n算法：\n$s_1 = (u_1 - l_1) / N, s_2 = (u_2 - l_2) / N$\n\ntmp_min=99999999; //tmp_min 初始化为一个很大的数\nfor $x_1 = l_1 : s_1 : u_1$ do\n    for $x_2 = l_2 : s_2 : u_2$ do\n    $x = [x_1, x_2]$;\n    if $g(x) \\leq 0$ and $f(x) &lt; tmp\\_min$ then\n    tmp_min= $f(x)$; //存储近似最优值\n    tmp_x = x; //存储相应决策\n    endIf\n    end for // x1\nend for // x2\n输出:\ntmp_min 近似最优解的目标函数值\ntmp_x 近似最优解\n</div>",
