    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.6. 蒙特卡罗法",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            28,
            41,
            332,
            99
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求解优化模型：n 元函数有约束最值问题",
        "bbox": [
            84,
            109,
            607,
            154
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "s.t. $\\left\\{ \\begin{array} { l l } { g ( x ) \\leq 0 } \\\\ { l _ { i } \\leq x _ { i } \\leq u _ { i } ( i = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , n ) } \\end{array} \\right.$",
        "bbox": [
            318,
            215,
            669,
            327
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "输入：",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            331,
            103,
            376
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "f (x) 目标函数",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            382,
            248,
            430
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "l n 维数组，其中 $l = ( l _ { 1 } , l _ { 2 } , \\cdots , l _ { n } )$",
        "bbox": [
            24,
            437,
            455,
            485
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "u n 维数组，其中 $\\boldsymbol { u } = ( u _ { 1 } , u _ { 2 } , \\cdots , u _ { n } )$",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            495,
            489,
            543
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "m 随机产生可行解个数",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            553,
            349,
            598
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "输出：",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            601,
            103,
            646
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "tmp\\_min 存储随机跳跃法求得的近似最优目标函数值",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            652,
            746,
            700
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "tmp\\_x 存储随机跳跃法求得的近似最优决策，n 维数组",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            700,
            797,
            749
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "临时变量：",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            752,
            161,
            797
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "n维数组 $x = \\left( x _ { 1 } , x _ { 2 } , \\cdots , x _ { n } \\right) ^ { T }$ 存储随机点",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            803,
            527,
            858
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "n维数组 $\\boldsymbol { r } = \\left( r _ { 1 } , r _ { 2 } , \\cdots , r _ { n } \\right) ^ { T }$ 存储伪随机数",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            868,
            556,
            922
        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "数学建模与实验",
        "bbox": [
            14,
