        ],
        "page_idx": 15
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.6.1. 简单约束的情形",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            26,
            61,
            407,
            118
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "min ( )f x",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            163,
            445,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\text { s.t. } \\quad l _ {i} \\leq x _ {i} \\leq u _ {i} (i = 1, 2, \\dots , n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            221,
            657,
            266
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【算法步骤】",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            40,
            292,
            195,
            337
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1. $\\scriptstyle { \\dot { 1 } } = 0$",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            347,
            134,
            389
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2. $\\mathrm { { t m p \\_ m i n = 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 } }$ ; //赋值为一个很大的数",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            395,
            674,
            440
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3. 随机产生n个在区间(0,1)上均匀分布的随机数 $r _ { j } ( j = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , n )$",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            443,
            872,
            491
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4. 令 $x _ { j } = l _ { j } + r _ { j } ( u _ { j } - l _ { j } ) , j = 1 , 2 , \\cdots , n \\ ; / /$ 产生在区间 $[ l _ { j } , u _ { j } ]$ 上均匀分布随机数",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            504,
            968,
            610
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5. $x = [ x _ { 1 } , x _ { 2 } , \\cdots , x _ { n } ]$",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            620,
            274,
            665
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "6. 如果 $f ( x ) < { \\mathrm { ~ t m p \\underline { { { \\ m i n } } } } }$ ,则 $\\mathrm { t m p \\_ m i n } { = } f ( x ) , \\mathrm { t m p \\_ x } = \\ x$",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            675,
            730,
            723
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "7. $\\mathbf { i } { = } \\mathbf { i } + 1$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            28,
            733,
            163,
            774
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "8. 如果i=m，则结束；否则跳到第 3步;",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            778,
            546,
            826
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "footer",
        "text": "数学建模与实验",
        "bbox": [
            16,
            951,
            173,
            983
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "16",
        "bbox": [
            484,
            967,
            513,
            996
        ],
        "page_idx": 16
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "algorithm",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "<div class=\"mineru-algorithm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-family:monospace;\">\n【伪代码描述】（类Matlab代码描述）\n已知： $l_{j} \\leq x_{j} \\leq u_{j}, j = 1,2,\\cdots,n$ \ntmp_min = 99999999\nfor i=1:m,\n    for j=1:n,\n    r(j)=rand; //  $r_{j}$  在区间[0,1]上均匀分\n    x(j)=1(j)+r(j)*(u(j)-1(j)); //  $x_{j}$  在区间 $[l_{j},u_{j}]$ 上均匀分布\n    end for\n    if f(x)&lt;tmp_min then\n    tmp_min =f(x);\n    tmp_x =x;\n    end if\nend for\n\n说明：\ntmp_min 的初始化可以放在 for 语句中：如果 i=1，则令 min_val=f(x)。\n数学建模与实验\n17\n</div>",
        "bbox": [
            26,
            22,
            939,
            993
        ],
        "page_idx": 17
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.6.2. 有非线性约束的情形",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            28,
            41,
            481,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 18
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "code",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "```txt\n1.6.2. 有非线性约束的情形\n    min f(x)\n求解模型: s.t. {g(x) ≤ 0\n    li ≤ xi ≤ ui (i = 1,2)\n\n本模型有 2 个决策变量: x₁, x₂, 一个不等式约束条件。\n\n输入: l₁, l₂, u₁, u₂, count 模拟的随机点个数\n\n算法: 求解二元函数约束最值问题\ntmp_min = inf; //inf 为一个很大的数\nfor i = 1 : count\n    x₁ = l₁ + (u₁ - l₁) * rand;\n    x₂ = l₂ + (u₂ - l₂) * rand;\n    x = [x₁, x₂];\n    if g(x) ≤ 0 and f(x) < tmp_min then\n    tmp_min = f(x); //存储最优值\n    tmp_x = x; //存储决策\n    end if\nend for //i\n\n输出:\ntmin //近似最优目标函数值\ntmp_x //近似最优决策\n说明:\nrand 为产生(0,1)上均匀分布的随机数.\n\n数学建模与实验\n```",
        "bbox": [
            16,
            64,
            987,
            990
        ],
        "page_idx": 18
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.7. 练习题",
